<urn:atm:triage:finding/ARCH-X1-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ARCH-X1-002" ;
  triage:title "atm-runtime-test-support/Cargo.toml: atm-rusqlite in [dependencies] not [dev-dependencies]" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-runtime-test-support/Cargo.toml — atm-rusqlite is listed under [dependencies] (line 17) instead of [dev-dependencies]. The crate is test-only infrastructure; its production dependency on atm-rusqlite creates a future coupling risk. Additionally, atm-core is also listed under [dependencies] (line 16) where a test-support crate would typically use dev-dependencies. The crate was introduced on pX-s1 and is present on pX-s5 (which merged forward from s1). It is absent on pX-s2, pX-s3, pX-s4, and integrate/phase-X (s1 not yet merged into those)." ;
